        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-015365",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our products like ServiceFabric® and our partnerships with managed services and cloud service providers further enhance the attractiveness of our data centers.",
        "start_character": 27282,
        "end_character": 27452
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-015365",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-015365-ef7e792602c7eaa0",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-015365",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that achieving appropriate risk-adjusted returns on our business, including on our development pipeline and leasing transactions, will deliver superior stockholder returns.",
        "start_character": 23284,
        "end_character": 23467
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-015365",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-015365-ef7e792602c7eaa0",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-015365",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that the growth trends in the data center market, technology, the cloud, internet traffic and internet-based services, combined with cost advantages in outsourcing data center requirements, provide attractive growth opportunities for us as a data center solutions provider.",
        "start_character": 6503,
        "end_character": 6787
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-015365",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-015365-ef7e792602c7eaa0",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-015365",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that the platform, through which we offer the foundational services of space, power and connectivity, will enable our customers and partners to serve their customers and grow their businesses.",
        "start_character": 27517,
        "end_character": 27720
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-015365",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-015365-ef7e792602c7eaa0",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-015365",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide an extensive Interconnection portfolio to support the movement of data across customers, service providers, and networks;",
        "start_character": 14296,
        "end_character": 14428
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-015365",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-015365-ef7e792602c7eaa0",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-015365",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "and furthered our position as a leading provider of colocation, interconnection and cloud-enablement services globally, we are able to offer one of the industry’s broadest range of data center solutions to meet our customers’ needs, from a single rack or cabinet to multi-megawatt deployments.",
        "start_character": 26988,
        "end_character": 27281
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-015365",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-015365-ef7e792602c7eaa0",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-015365",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "During 2025, we sought to play an active role in supporting the communities we operate in across North America, EMEA and APAC.",
        "start_character": 46981,
        "end_character": 47107
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-015365",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-015365-ef7e792602c7eaa0",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-015365",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe that enterprise decisionmakers will need to increasingly consider how Data Gravity impacts their enterprise IT architectures and, accordingly, we have developed the Data Gravity Index: a global forecast that measures the intensity and gravitational force of enterprise data growth.",
        "start_character": 2555,
        "end_character": 2847
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-015365",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-015365-ef7e792602c7eaa0",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-015365",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We consider cooling system designs to maximize ‘free cooling’ and reduce or eliminate reliance on water for cooling, and we utilize landscape irrigation monitoring solutions to reduce water consumption.",
        "start_character": 39253,
        "end_character": 39455
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-015365",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-015365-ef7e792602c7eaa0",
